---
import RatedBadge from "../components/RatedBadge.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";

const costFaqs = [
  { q: "Is the assessment really free?", a: "Yes — completely. The home visit and your tailored care plan are free and no-obligation. You're never charged to find out whether we're the right fit for your family." },
  { q: "Are there any hidden fees?", a: "No. Our hourly rates include everything — there are no travel or call-out charges, and home care is VAT-exempt. The only extra is mileage at 55p a mile if we drive you out and about, always agreed with you first." },
  { q: "Can I use council funding or Direct Payments?", a: "Yes. We support clients funded by Wiltshire and Somerset councils and accept Direct Payments, as well as private self-funding. We're happy to invoice the council directly where that's the arrangement." },
  { q: "How and when do I pay?", a: "Care is invoiced regularly and paid by Direct Debit, so there's nothing to remember. We'll talk you through the costs clearly before you commit — no surprises, ever." },
];
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  mainEntity: costFaqs.map((f) => ({
    "@type": "Question",
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: f.a },
  })),
};
---
<SiteLayout title="Costs & Funding | Otter Homecare" description="Clear, honest home care pricing and the funding that may help.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · Costs & Funding</div><h1>Clear, honest pricing</h1><p>No hidden fees, no hard sell — an honest guide to what home care costs with Otter, and the funding that may help towards it.</p></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Indicative rates</span><h2>What home care costs</h2><p class="lede">Final pricing depends on the support you need — you'll get a clear, personalised quote at your free assessment.</p></div><div class="rates reveal">
<div class="rate"><span class="rtag">Visiting Care</span><span class="from">from</span><div class="amt">£36<small>/ hour</small></div><p>Flexible visits for help with daily life.</p></div>
<div class="rate"><span class="rtag">Live-in Care</span><span class="from">from</span><div class="amt">£1,550<small>/ week</small></div><p>Round-the-clock, one-to-one care in your own home.</p></div>
<div class="rate"><span class="rtag">Free assessment</span><span class="from">always</span><div class="amt">£0</div><p>A no-obligation home visit and tailored care plan.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="reveal" style="margin-top:34px"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px">Visiting care — full rates</h3>
<table class="ratetable"><thead><tr><th>Visit length</th><th>Mon–Fri</th><th>Weekend</th><th>Bank holiday</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>1 hour</td><td>£36.00</td><td>£40.00</td><td>£48.00</td></tr>
<tr><td>45 minutes</td><td>£31.75</td><td>£34.75</td><td>£41.75</td></tr>
<tr><td>30 minutes</td><td>£27.50</td><td>£29.50</td><td>£35.50</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">No travel or call-out fees · VAT-exempt · Mileage for client outings charged at 55p/mile.</p></div>
<div class="reveal" style="margin-top:34px"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px">Live-in care</h3>
<p style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;max-width:60ch">Round-the-clock, one-to-one care in your own home — a genuine alternative to a care home. The weekly rate depends on how much support is needed.</p>
<div class="livein-bands">
<div class="lb"><span class="lb-band">Band A</span><span class="lb-rate">£1,550<small>/wk</small></span><span class="lb-note">Lower dependency</span></div>
<div class="lb"><span class="lb-band">Band B</span><span class="lb-rate">£1,650<small>/wk</small></span><span class="lb-note">Medium dependency</span></div>
<div class="lb"><span class="lb-band">Band C</span><span class="lb-rate">£1,800<small>/wk</small></span><span class="lb-note">Higher dependency</span></div>
</div>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px">Your dependency band (A / B / C) is set after your free assessment.</p></div>
<div class="reveal" style="margin-top:34px"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px">Overnight care</h3>
<table class="ratetable"><thead><tr><th>Care type</th><th>Weekday</th><th>Weekend</th><th>Bank holiday</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Sleeping night (9 hrs)</td><td>£240</td><td>£260</td><td>£280</td></tr>
<tr><td>Waking night (9 hrs)</td><td>£290</td><td>£320</td><td>£350</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">A sleeping night covers occasional support; a waking night is for active care through the night.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky tmt"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><h2>Help paying for care</h2></div>
<p class="lede reveal" style="max-width:62ch;margin:0 auto 6px;text-align:center">Not sure whether you'll pay for care yourself or get help from the council? As a rough guide: with <strong>savings and assets over £23,250</strong> you'll usually fund your own care; <strong>under £14,250</strong> the council should cover most or all of it; in between, you contribute on a sliding scale. Either way, asking your council for an assessment is free — and always worth doing.</p>
<div class="funding reveal"><div class="fund"><h3>Local Authority funding</h3><p>After a free needs and means assessment, your council may fund some or all of your care. We support clients funded by both <strong>Wiltshire</strong> and <strong>Somerset</strong> councils.</p><a href="https://adults.wiltshire.gov.uk/Information/assessment-of-need" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wiltshire — request an assessment →</a><a href="https://www.somerset.gov.uk/social-care-and-health/paying-for-your-care/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Somerset — paying for your care →</a></div><div class="fund"><h3>Attendance Allowance</h3><p>A non-means-tested, tax-free benefit for those over State Pension age who need help with personal care — <strong>£76.70 or £114.60 a week</strong> depending on the level of help. Worth claiming even if you fund your own care.</p><a href="https://www.gov.uk/attendance-allowance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check eligibility →</a></div><div class="fund"><h3>Self-funding</h3><p>Many families pay privately for the flexibility and choice it brings. We keep pricing transparent, with no travel or call-out fees.</p></div><div class="fund"><h3>NHS Continuing Healthcare</h3><p>If care is needed mainly for health reasons, the NHS may fully fund it, whoever provides the care.</p><a href="https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/social-care-and-support-guide/money-work-and-benefits/nhs-continuing-healthcare/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the NHS guide →</a></div></div>
<p class="reveal" style="text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:20px auto 0;max-width:60ch">Benefit rates and capital thresholds are correct as of June 2026 and reviewed each April. This is general guidance, not financial advice — your council or an independent adviser can confirm what applies to you.</p></div></section>
<section class="section trustwhy"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2>Costs &amp; funding questions</h2></div><div class="faqs reveal">{costFaqs.map((f) => (<div class="faq"><button type="button">{f.q}<span class="tog">+</span></button><div class="ans"><p>{f.a}</p></div></div>))}</div></div></section>
<section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span><h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/contact">Book a free assessment</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a></div></div><div class="book-trust reveal"><div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div><RatedBadge /></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
